--- fixed U<3,3>  (radix 2, 64 values)
    verdict            : INSIDE
    binades            : 6 (1 hold one value and pin no step)
    affine grid        : True   (adjustment 1/8, bias 0)
    Flocq generic_format (bias zero, step a power of the radix): True
    canonical exponent : {-2:0, -1:0, 0:0, 1:0, 2:0}  distinct=1
    family             : FIXED: one segment

