    canonical exponent : {-2:0, -1:1, 0:2, 1:3, 2:4, 3:5}  distinct=6
    family             : FLOAT: fexp(e) = e - -2

--- float p=3 e=-2..3, subnormals  (radix 2, 28 values)
    verdict            : INSIDE
    binades            : 8 (1 hold one value and pin no step)
    affine grid        : True   (adjustment 1/16, bias 0)
